# Dish videos DO ship in the repo.
#
# They were excluded here originally, which meant the hero video played on a
# developer's machine and silently fell back to a still image on Vercel — the
# file simply was not in the deployment. A background loop that only works
# locally is worse than no video at all, because nobody notices it is broken.
#
# Keep each clip small: they are muted, looping, decorative backgrounds, not
# films. Aim for under 3 MB (see README for the ffmpeg command). GitHub warns
# above 50 MB per file and refuses above 100 MB; if the collection outgrows
# that, move to Vercel Blob and store the URLs on MenuItem.video instead.
/public/videos/*.mov
/public/videos/*.avi
/public/videos/*.mkv
